  "title": "Chocolate Chip Cookies for Special Diets",
  "description": "Be sure to use a heat-stable sugar substitute in these sugar-free chocolate chip cookies. Since substitutes vary in strength, use an amount equal to 3/4 cup regular sugar according to the package.",
